  "description": "Plan and run manual tests of the project's running app. Runs a session in one of five modes: exploratory, verification, smoke, assessment (UX, localization, accessibility, improvement review), or AI probe. Also writes a manual test plan that holds only what automated tests cannot judge. Use whenever the user asks, in any language, for something to be tested by hand or for a manual test plan — \"manual test\", \"exploratory test\", \"bug hunt\", \"verify the bug fix\", \"smoke test\", \"QA this screen\", \"review this screen's UX\", \"what would you improve\", \"check the localized copy\", \"test the AI agent's answers\", \"write manual test cases\", \"kịch bản test manual\" — or assigns a test design, test plan or test-case IDs to execute by hand. Not for writing automated tests.",
